{"seq":1,"slug":"product-lifecycle-stage-age-structure","title":"生命周期阶段与库龄结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/lifecycle-deadstock-detect/product-lifecycle-stage-age-structure","wordCount":1949,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生命周期阶段与库龄结构\">生命周期阶段与库龄结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个 SKU 的&quot;死&quot;不是单一事件，而是两条曲线叠加的结果：<strong>需求的生命周期曲线</strong>在自然衰减，<strong>库存的时间曲线</strong>在持续累积。前者告诉你这个款还能卖多久，后者告诉你这批货已经等了多久。清仓决策要判断的是这两条曲线的交点是否已经越过了&quot;还能收回成本&quot;的位置。</p>\n<p>因此第一步必须把&quot;生命周期阶段&quot;与&quot;库龄结构&quot;分开建模再合并。生命周期是**款级（style-level）<strong>属性，描述需求形态；库龄是</strong>批次级（lot-level）**属性，描述这部分实物资产的历史长度。同一个款式在生命周期成熟期进的货，放到衰退期就变成了高账龄库存——阶段决定它值不值得推，账龄决定它必须多快走。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新品引入] --&gt; B[成长期&lt;br/&gt;周环比为正]&#10;  B --&gt; C[成熟期&lt;br/&gt;需求平稳波动小]&#10;  C --&gt; D{连续 N 周&lt;br/&gt;销量下滑}&#10;  D --&gt;|趋势确认| E[衰退期&lt;br/&gt;进入降价候选池]&#10;  D --&gt;|仅波动| C&#10;  E --&gt; F{剩余流速 vs 截止线}&#10;  F --&gt;|可覆盖| G[维持正价&lt;br/&gt;限流投放]&#10;  F --&gt;|不可覆盖| H[进入 markdown 决策]&#10;  H --&gt; I[清仓渠道分流]\">graph TD\n  A[新品引入] --&gt; B[成长期&lt;br/&gt;周环比为正]\n  B --&gt; C[成熟期&lt;br/&gt;需求平稳波动小]\n  C --&gt; D{连续 N 周&lt;br/&gt;销量下滑}\n  D --&gt;|趋势确认| E[衰退期&lt;br/&gt;进入降价候选池]\n  D --&gt;|仅波动| C\n  E --&gt; F{剩余流速 vs 截止线}\n  F --&gt;|可覆盖| G[维持正价&lt;br/&gt;限流投放]\n  F --&gt;|不可覆盖| H[进入 markdown 决策]\n  H --&gt; I[清仓渠道分流]</pre><p>阶段判定的核心难点在于<strong>区分趋势与噪声</strong>。零售日销的方差极大，连续两周下滑完全可能是随机波动。工业界常见的做法是引入长度足够的观察窗口加趋势检验，而不是单周同比——这一点与 markdown 优化中&quot;何时启动降价&quot;的时机问题直接相连，见 <a href=\"../markdown-decision-optimization/markdown-timing-depth-elasticity\">markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>判定信号（示例口径）</th>\n<th>需求形态</th>\n<th>库存动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引入期</td>\n<td>上架 &lt; 8 周，样本量不足</td>\n<td>高波动、低基数</td>\n<td>观察，不降价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成长期</td>\n<td>4 周移动平均周环比 &gt; 0</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>补货，保护价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟期</td>\n<td>变异系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV&lt;0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 且无趋势</td>\n<td>平稳</td>\n<td>正常周转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰退期</td>\n<td>8 周斜率显著为负</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>进入降价候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终末期</td>\n<td>同款已下架或替代款上市</td>\n<td>趋零</td>\n<td>立即清仓/处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期阶段的判定口径\">生命周期阶段的判定口径</h2><h3 id=\"趋势检验而非单点比较\">趋势检验而非单点比较</h3><p>用&quot;本周销量 &lt; 上周销量&quot;作为衰退判据会制造大量误报。更稳的做法是对最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 周的历史需求拟合一条趋势，例如最小二乘斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_1 = \\frac{\\sum_{t=1}^{n}(t-\\bar{t})(d_t-\\bar{d})}{\\sum_{t=1}^{n}(t-\\bar{t})^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5149em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5209em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著为负（用残差标准误构造 t 统计量）且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 足够长时，才转入衰退期。窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的选择是偏差-方差的权衡：窗口太短噪声大，太长则对真实断崖反应迟钝。服装、消费电子这类有明显季节性的品类通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>；长周期耐用品可以取到 12–13 周以跨越季节噪声。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变异系数与需求稳定性\">变异系数与需求稳定性</h3><p>成熟期的特征是&quot;量稳定&quot;而非&quot;量高&quot;。用变异系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV=\\sigma_d/\\mu_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 刻画相对波动比用绝对标准差更可比——高销量 SKU 的绝对波动天然更大。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 长期低于阈值且斜率接近零时，可判定为成熟期，此时任何降价都是对毛利的无谓让渡，因为需求不会因为降价而显著增加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"替代款的干扰\">替代款的干扰</h3><p>新款上市会人为制造旧款的&quot;阶段跃迁&quot;。如果只看旧款自身曲线，会把它归入自然衰退；但真实原因是替代效应。因此阶段判定需要引入同品类/同价格带的替代信号，否则会对已经被战略淘汰的款式继续按衰退期做渐进降价，而不是一次性清仓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库龄结构的建模\">库龄结构的建模</h2><h3 id=\"账龄桶的切分\">账龄桶的切分</h3><p>库龄结构通常按&quot;入库日至今天数&quot;切桶统计，桶边界应与品类的周转周期对齐，而不是照抄 30/60/90 这种通用写法。快时尚品类可能用 0–15 / 16–30 / 31–60 / 61–90 / 90+；家电则可能是 0–90 / 91–180 / 181–365 / 365+。桶的本质是把连续账龄离散化成可做决策分组的维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inventory_age_fact (&#10;  snapshot_date   DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  warehouse_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id          BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  lot_id          BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  received_date   DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  age_days        INT         GENERATED ALWAYS AS (DATEDIFF(&#39;day&#39;, received_date, snapshot_date)) STORED,&#10;  age_bucket      VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,          -- &#39;0_15&#39;,&#39;16_30&#39;,&#39;31_60&#39;,&#39;61_90&#39;,&#39;90_plus&#39;&#10;  on_hand_qty     DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  reserved_qty    DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  cost_unit       DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,        -- FIFO 成本层单价&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (snapshot_date, warehouse_id, sku_id, lot_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 按账龄桶聚合的可售库存与资金占用&#10;SELECT age_bucket,&#10;       SUM(on_hand_qty - reserved_qty)              AS available_qty,&#10;       SUM((on_hand_qty - reserved_qty) * cost_unit) AS tied_capital&#10;FROM inventory_age_fact&#10;WHERE snapshot_date = :snap&#10;GROUP BY age_bucket&#10;ORDER BY age_bucket;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_age_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_date   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_date   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  age_days        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DATEDIFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, received_date, snapshot_date)) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  age_bucket      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- '0_15','16_30','31_60','61_90','90_plus'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  on_hand_qty     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserved_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_unit       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FIFO 成本层单价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_date, warehouse_id, sku_id, lot_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按账龄桶聚合的可售库存与资金占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_unit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tied_capital</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_age_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapshot_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :snap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_bucket;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可售库存与预留库存的剥离\">可售库存与预留库存的剥离</h3><p>账龄结构必须基于<strong>可售库存</strong>（on-hand 减去已分配未出库的 reserved），否则已被订单占用的部分会虚增&quot;待清仓量&quot;，导致降价决策面对一个并不存在的库存规模。这一口径与后端库存服务的一致性是硬约束，口径漂移是清仓报表最难排查的一类缺陷。</p>\n<h3 id=\"快照与增量\">快照与增量</h3><p>账龄结构是<strong>每日快照</strong>而非实时计算的结果。原因有二：账龄本身以天为粒度变化，日内多次计算没有信息增益；以及历史快照保留了&quot;结构如何演化&quot;的证据，可以做趋势诊断（例如&quot;90+ 桶连续 3 周扩大&quot;是比单点阈值更强的告警信号）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库龄与成本的绑定\">库龄与成本的绑定</h2><p>账龄不是纯粹的物理属性，它直接决定财务口径下的资产价值。存货准则要求以<strong>成本与可变现净值孰低</strong>计量：当售价下滑到某个水平，库存必须计提跌价准备。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>按 IAS 2，存货应按&quot;成本与可变现净值孰低&quot;计量；可变现净值是&quot;正常经营过程中的估计售价&quot;减去估计完工成本与销售必需费用，跌价损失&quot;在该跌价或损失发生的期间确认为费用&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IAS 2 Inventories，IFRS Foundation</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这一条把库龄结构与下一章连了起来：降价不仅是运营动作，也是让账面价值向真实可变现价值回归的财务动作。降得不够快，跌价准备就要计提；降得过头，毛利回收受损。</p>\n<h3 id=\"批次追溯的标识基础\">批次追溯的标识基础</h3><p>账龄结构能精确到批次，前提是系统知道&quot;哪些实物属于哪个批次&quot;。这正是 EPCIS 这类可见性事件标准解决的问题：它定义了以事件方式记录对象在业务流程中状态变化的标准，其中 TransformationEvent 描述&quot;输入被转化为输出&quot;的过程（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EPCIS\">EPCIS 2.0，GS1 于 2022-06 批准</a>）。对清仓场景而言，批次级账龄是&quot;哪一批货该降价&quot;的最小证据单位——没有它，降价只能按 SKU 整体执行，会连带降掉本还能正价卖出的新批次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段与库龄的联合分桶\">阶段与库龄的联合分桶</h2><p>单看任一张表都会误判。正确的做法是把两个维度做笛卡尔积，得到九宫格式的分流矩阵：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 阶段&#10;    M[成熟期]&#10;    D[衰退期]&#10;    E[终末期]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 账龄&#10;    Y[低账龄]&#10;    O[高账龄]&#10;  end&#10;  M --&gt; MY[正常周转]&#10;  M --&gt; MO[先正价消化高账龄批]&#10;  D --&gt; DY[小幅试探性降价]&#10;  D --&gt; DO[主力降价标的]&#10;  E --&gt; EO[一次性清仓或处置]\">graph LR\n  subgraph 阶段\n    M[成熟期]\n    D[衰退期]\n    E[终末期]\n  end\n  subgraph 账龄\n    Y[低账龄]\n    O[高账龄]\n  end\n  M --&gt; MY[正常周转]\n  M --&gt; MO[先正价消化高账龄批]\n  D --&gt; DY[小幅试探性降价]\n  D --&gt; DO[主力降价标的]\n  E --&gt; EO[一次性清仓或处置]</pre><p>高账龄 + 成熟期的组合最容易被忽视：款式还卖得动，所以没人关注系统里那批半年前进的货。但它恰恰是最值得优先处理的一类——正价需求尚在，用一次小幅降价就能把旧批次清理掉，不必等到整个款式进入衰退期再大范围降价。这个&quot;优先级排序&quot;的输出，就是第 2 篇 <a href=\"deadstock-identify-weeks-of-supply\">滞销/死库存识别与周供应量 WOS</a> 要量化的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生命周期是款级需求属性，库龄是批次级资产属性，清仓决策必须两者联合分桶而非各看一张表。</li>\n<li>阶段判定要看<strong>趋势显著性</strong>而非单点环比，并用变异系数区分&quot;量低&quot;与&quot;量不稳&quot;；替代款上市会伪造衰退信号。</li>\n<li>账龄桶边界应对齐品类周转周期；账龄统计必须基于可售库存（剥离预留），并保留每日快照做趋势诊断。</li>\n<li>库龄直接绑定财务口径：成本与可变现净值孰低要求降价与跌价准备计提同步考虑。</li>\n<li>批次级追溯（EPCIS 事件、TransformationEvent）是&quot;只降该降的批次&quot;的前提。</li>\n<li>下一步：把账龄结构转成&quot;还能卖多少周&quot;的流速指标，见 <a href=\"deadstock-identify-weeks-of-supply\">周供应量 WOS</a>；若库存带效期，则还需叠加 <a href=\"expiry-seasonal-obsolescence-risk\">效期与季节性风险</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生命周期阶段与库龄结构","id":"生命周期阶段与库龄结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期阶段的判定口径","id":"生命周期阶段的判定口径"},{"level":3,"text":"趋势检验而非单点比较","id":"趋势检验而非单点比较"},{"level":3,"text":"变异系数与需求稳定性","id":"变异系数与需求稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"替代款的干扰","id":"替代款的干扰"},{"level":2,"text":"库龄结构的建模","id":"库龄结构的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"账龄桶的切分","id":"账龄桶的切分"},{"level":3,"text":"可售库存与预留库存的剥离","id":"可售库存与预留库存的剥离"},{"level":3,"text":"快照与增量","id":"快照与增量"},{"level":2,"text":"库龄与成本的绑定","id":"库龄与成本的绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"批次追溯的标识基础","id":"批次追溯的标识基础"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段与库龄的联合分桶","id":"阶段与库龄的联合分桶"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"滞销/死库存识别与周供应量 WOS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/lifecycle-deadstock-detect/deadstock-identify-weeks-of-supply"}}